name: Reserved Parking — king payout
author: corpus
description: >-
  Event: Reserved Parking triggers its $1 payout on a King held in hand. Tight Ante 1 event:
  a King is held and pays.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - parkingPayout: [1]
should:
  - joker: ReservedParking
    score: 45
  - joker: Baron
    score: 40
  - joker: Mime
    score: 35
